{
  "info": {
    "name": "HF Medusa — Suggestive Selling + VoucherEngine (Complete API)",
    "description": "Complete REST API collection for Suggestive Selling (Day 3–4 · Sơn) and VoucherEngine (Day 1–4 · Thức, Hùng) — every route under `apps/backend/src/api/`.\n\n**Store APIs (Customer-Facing):**\n- GET /store/products/:id/suggestions — product-level recommendations\n- GET /store/carts/:id/suggestions — cart-level CR-01..CR-04 recommendations\n- POST /store/carts/:id/suggested-items — add suggested item to cart\n- POST /store/carts/:id/voucher — apply voucher (optional `?replace=true`)\n- DELETE /store/carts/:id/voucher — remove voucher\n- GET /store/customers/me/vouchers — fetch customer's applied/redeemed vouchers (optional `?cart_id=`)\n- GET /store/vouchers — public/guest-reachable available-vouchers list (optional `?cart_id=`)\n- POST /store/suggestion-events — log analytics events (view/add/filter)\n\n**Admin APIs (Management):**\n- Suggestion Rules (CRUD) — manage cart rules (CR-01..04 config)\n- Category Complement Mappings (CRUD) — CR-01 category pairs\n- Product Bulk Mappings (CRUD) — CR-04 single↔bulk product pairs\n- Category Top Sellers (read) — Tier-2 ranking snapshot for sales-desc order\n- Suggestion Events (read) — aggregated analytics\n- Vouchers (create only — list route was retired 2026-07-21 in favor of the unified Promotion model)\n- Discount Cap Config (read/upsert) — the single active global-cap row\n- Promotions × VoucherEngine (Unified Model) — attach/read/disable a VoucherConfig on a native Promotion\n\n**Dev-only:**\n- GET /docs, /docs/openapi, /docs/openapi/core — Swagger UI + auto-generated OpenAPI specs (no auth)\n\n**Auth & Headers:**\n- Store: x-publishable-api-key (from seed, default provided); optional bearer token for customer context\n- Admin: bearer token (JWT from login); x-publishable-api-key for store-facing admin dashboards\n- Session: x-session-id (optional, scopes dismissal + analytics per session)\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Run Setup › Login to get admin token\n2. Run Setup › Get Publishable Key\n3. Run Setup › Create Cart + Add Items\n4. Then run Store › Suggestions / Vouchers workflows\n\n**Note:** All endpoints follow the degrade contract (BR-10) — failures return HTTP 200 with empty results, not 5xx. Tests assert shape, not non-emptiness.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:9009",
